        <mxCell id="c104" value="&lt;i&gt;The tab Control Totals after Requirement 2, run: seven tests, each Pass with a Difference of 0. The editor is drawn without lines 5 to 17, the first six tests (a gray bar), and values are written to the cent. Outlined, in the editor and in the grid: the reconciling item, the ledger&#x27;s invoice revenue less the invoice lines, 4,582.37. It is the invoices SI-2026-013741 to 013743, dated in late 2025 and posted on 2026-01-01, so the query tests it as its own expected value and does not leave it as a failure.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="754" width="860" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
